@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>Terms | Artisanal Brew</PageTitle>

<section class="page-intro">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
        <h1>This is a public testnet demonstration.</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">
        ArtisanalBrew is a recruiter-facing storefront and agent-commerce demo. It is not a licensed coffee shop, payment institution, or brokerage. Completing checkout does not create a shipment, refund, or consumer-sale contract.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="visit-grid">
    <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">What you are paying</p>
        <h2>Testnet value only</h2>
        <p>
            Checkout settles native ETH on Ethereum Sepolia at a fixed demo USD rate. That rate is not a live market quote. Other networks stay disabled until they have their own honest quote path.
        </p>
        <p>
            Tokens, faucets, staking receipts, and agent payments on this site are test fixtures. Do not send mainnet assets or treat balances as money.
        </p>
    </article>
    <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">What you are not buying</p>
        <h2>No roast, no dispatch</h2>
        <p>
            Catalog prices, shipping, and tax exist so the checkout path can be exercised. They do not represent a physical fulfillment obligation. There is no chargeback desk, no carrier, and no customer-support SLA.
        </p>
        <p>
            Admin tools, receipts, and wallet login are part of the demonstration. Wallet signatures prove control of an address; they are not a legal identity check.
        </p>
    </article>
</section>
